OL,3,GNEWSACambridge United in talks over new
OL,4,Astadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football club is exploring building a
OL,7,Fnew 15,000-capacity stadium in the
OL,8,Foutskirts of a city, it has been
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
OL,11,FCambridge United said it had started
OL,12,Fdiscussions with a local developer and
OL,13,Fa planning body about relocating the
OL,14,Fclub to land around the city's airport,
OL,15,Fwhich will be closed by 2029.
OL,17,FNo sides have made any formal
OL,18,Fcommitments and work to explore the
OL,19,Fsite's feasibility was due to conclude
OL,20,Fby Easter, the club said.
