OL,3,GNEWSACambridge United in talks over new
OL,4,Astadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FChairman Godric Smith said he expected
OL,7,Fthe League One side to continue playing
OL,8,Fat their current home ` the Abbey
OL,9,FStadium ` "for the best part of the
OL,10,Fnext decade regardless of any potential
OL,11,Frelocation".
